      "shortDescription": "Rietschoten Elephant Brakes is the industrial-braking product line of ATEK Drive Solutions. The official range includes lever, fixed-caliper, floating-caliper and shaft brakes, engineered brake systems and accessories with mechanical, pneumatic, hydraulic or electric actuation.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official ATEK sources identify Rietschoten Elephant Brakes as the continuing industrial-brake product line of ATEK Drive Solutions GmbH. The range originated with Deutsche van Rietschoten & Houwens GmbH, a German brake specialist founded in 1961 that merged with ATEK Antriebstechnik in 2024 to form the current Rellingen-based company.",
        "The documented portfolio covers RH and EMS lever brakes, EB and EBS fixed-caliper brakes, EBS FL floating-caliper brakes, WFG shaft brakes, WBA marine shaft-brake systems and related accessories. Active and fail-safe configurations are available with mechanical, pneumatic, hydraulic or electrical actuation for machinery, lifting, conveying, heavy-industry and marine applications."
      ],
