      "shortDescription": "EMEC designs and manufactures equipment for water treatment and chemical dosing. Its portfolio includes motor-driven, stepper and solenoid dosing pumps, controllers, measurement probes, disinfection and preassembled dosing systems, pulse-output water meters and accessories.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official company sources identify EMEC Srl as an Italian manufacturer established in 1982 and headquartered operationally in Rieti. The company designs, manufactures and markets chemical-control, dosing and water-treatment systems, with product development and production managed at its own facilities.",
        "EMEC's documented portfolio covers PRIUS motor-driven pumps, PRISMA and VELON stepper pumps, multiple solenoid-driven pump series, process controllers, probes, water meters, disinfection equipment and preassembled systems. These technologies support municipal and industrial water treatment, pools, cooling towers, food and chemical processes, oil applications and agricultural water management."
