      "statusModifier": "ACQUIRED_BRAND",
      "shortDescription": "Facet Filtration develops and manufactures filtration and separation equipment for fuel, oil and wastewater. Its range includes cartridges, housings, complete filtration systems, oil-water and bilge-water separators, and turbine-oil conditioning equipment for aviation, power, industrial and marine applications.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official Facet sources trace the business to Warner Lewis Company, established in 1943, and identify Tulsa, Oklahoma as its headquarters. The company's documented history records the Facet International name from 1994; the current commercial identity is Facet Filtration, now presented within the Donaldson Facet brand after Donaldson completed its acquisition in May 2026.",
        "Facet designs and manufactures cartridges, housings and engineered systems for filtering and separating contaminants from aviation fuel, industrial fuels and oils, marine fluids and wastewater. Its portfolio also covers oil-water and bilge-water separators, turbine-oil conditioning equipment and application-specific filtration systems."
